    <briefdescription>
<para>Field-traits tag used as the template parameter of <computeroutput><ref refid="class_s_l_p" kindref="compound">SLP</ref>&lt;<ref refid="submodules_2mathicgb_2src_2mathicgb_2polyring_8hpp_aa56106941a453e03ff5dde0a32d208db_1aa56106941a453e03ff5dde0a32d208db" kindref="member">Field</ref>&gt;</computeroutput> to pick the <computeroutput><ref refid="classcomplex" kindref="compound">complex</ref></computeroutput> element type. </para>
