    <detaileddescription>
<para>The only data is the <computeroutput><ref refid="class_complex_field_a6570abff1ab7ebbe11d62128b3b7684d_1a6570abff1ab7ebbe11d62128b3b7684d" kindref="member">element_type</ref></computeroutput> typedef <mdash/> field operations (<computeroutput>add</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>mul</computeroutput>, ...) come from free functions on <computeroutput><ref refid="classcomplex" kindref="compound">complex</ref></computeroutput> rather than methods, so the class itself is empty. Acts as the non-<computeroutput><ref refid="class_a_ring" kindref="compound">ARing</ref></computeroutput> evaluator&apos;s field-of-record. </para>
